  "details": "This is 2024 3rd quarter the ability to send friends is a esential feature that should have been implimented already . the underlying code already exist to suport such features using code from the invite system with the ability to delcline with a message. the excuse that it dosent fit the design vrc intends is not a very good excuse. vrc already feel like it is in a decline and it has lost a good amout of its attractiveness to players.  VRC needs to take the aproach of supporting its users and what they are asking for.\n\n Their are many metrhods to stay to the design vision the vrc team has for the game, but using it as an excuse for no implemention. it should be what the comunity wants and how do we bring the comunity closer together for further engagement and how do we bring new users in to make them exciteed about the game.",
